{"id":"22f0af31d974b262","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-set11-rank-bounded-transitive-set.md","title":"ZFC Set11 Rank Bounded Transitive Set","display":"df-zfc-set11-rank-bounded-transitive-set — ZFC Set11 Rank Bounded Transitive Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set11-rank-bounded-transitive-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set11-rank-bounded-transitive-set"],"display":"df-zfc-set11-rank-bounded-transitive-set — ZFC Set11 Rank Bounded Transitive Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-set-transitive-set]]","[[58-df-zfc-rank-map]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-set9-set-rank.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set11-rank-bounded-transitive-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set11-rank-bounded-transitive-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set11-rank-bounded-transitive-set — ZFC Set11 Rank Bounded Transitive Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1e75cf0c92655d78\" href=\"?note=1e75cf0c92655d78\" title=\"58-df-zfc-set-transitive-set\">58-df-zfc-set-transitive-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b7440ca29cd784bc\" href=\"?note=b7440ca29cd784bc\" title=\"58-df-zfc-rank-map\">58-df-zfc-rank-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3f5a5d2316370c0b\" href=\"?note=3f5a5d2316370c0b\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-set9-set-rank.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-set9-set-rank.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\alpha\\in V\">\\(M,\\alpha\\in V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSetTransitiveSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSetTransitiveSet}_S\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> 使用所列依赖。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet9SetRank}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet9SetRank}_S\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3f5a5d2316370c0b\" href=\"?note=3f5a5d2316370c0b\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-set9-set-rank.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-set9-set-rank.md</a> 的集合秩关系。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet11RankBoundedTransitiveSet}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet11RankBoundedTransitiveSet}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> 由下式定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}rank\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet11RankBoundedTransitiveSet}_S(M,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcSetTransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\n\\forall x\\in M\\;\\exists\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;\\mathrm{ZfcSet9SetRank}_S(x,\\beta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}rank\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet11RankBoundedTransitiveSet}_S(M,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcSetTransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\n\\forall x\\in M\\;\\exists\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;\\mathrm{ZfcSet9SetRank}_S(x,\\beta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>保留“每个成员的秩严格小于 alpha”的原条件；不改成 M 自身的秩严格小于 alpha。</li>\n<li>每次秩计算仅需集合传递闭包上的递归，不再存在量化全局秩真类。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-set-transitive-set","status":"resolved","id":"1e75cf0c92655d78","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-set-transitive-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-rank-map","status":"resolved","id":"b7440ca29cd784bc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-rank-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-set9-set-rank.md","status":"resolved","id":"3f5a5d2316370c0b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-set9-set-rank.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-set9-set-rank.md","status":"resolved","id":"3f5a5d2316370c0b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcSet9SetRank}_S$ 使用 [[../batch13/58-df-zfc-set9-set-rank.md]] 的集合秩关系。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\alpha\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSetTransitiveSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet9SetRank}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet11RankBoundedTransitiveSet}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}rank\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet11RankBoundedTransitiveSet}_S(M,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcSetTransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\n\\forall x\\in M\\;\\exists\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;\\mathrm{ZfcSet9SetRank}_S(x,\\beta).","display":true}],"bytes":1368,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3413","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-set11-rank-bounded-transitive-set.md|58-df-zfc-set11-rank-bounded-transitive-set]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","1e75cf0c92655d78","b7440ca29cd784bc","5582a281f15a33c2","3f5a5d2316370c0b"]}